ure10\\text{-}nonatomic\\text{-}measure} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10NonatomicMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\bigl(\\mu(A)&gt;0\\to\n\\exists B\\in\\mathcal F\\;(B\\subseteq A\\land0&lt;\\mu(B)&lt;\\mu(A))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure10\\text{-}nonatomic\\text{-}measure} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10NonatomicMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\bigl(\\mu(A)&gt;0\\to\n\\exists B\\in\\mathcal F\\;(B\\subseteq A\\land0&lt;\\mu(B)&lt;\\mu(A))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary nonatomicity definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mu,X,\\mathcal F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10NonatomicMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure10\\text{-}nonatomic\\text{-}measure} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10NonatomicMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\bigl(\\mu(A)>0\\to\n\\exists B\\in\\mathcal F\\;(B\\subseteq A\\land0<\\mu(B)<\\mu(A))\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":914,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2546","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-measure10-nonatomic-measure.md|58-df-zfc-measure10-nonatomic-measure]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["ca832ed6bc22f728"]}